  "definition": "Time on Driving Simulator",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-04-05",
  "historyNote": "#9568, eff 10-17-09 (from Saf-C 3113.08); ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3114.10) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
